{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46の池田瑛紗です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【ありがたいこと】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "14th YEAR BIRTHDAY LIVE🎂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5月19日(火)～21日(木)＠東京ドーム"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/s/n46/page/14th_birthday_live"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみだ〜！と言っていただけてとてもありがたい限りです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "現地観覧の他、配信チケットも全日程ありますのでもし興味があればチェックしていただけますと嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46のお誕生日、そして我らがキャプテン美波さんの門出を素敵な日々にしましょうっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私事ですが、5月12日で24歳になりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Instagram"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日この後18時すぎ〜くらいからインスタライブをしたいなと思っています⊂(ᴖ ̫ᴖ  )⊃"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "@teresaikedaofficialも1周年！ということで…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんに感謝の気持ちを伝えさせてください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ストーリーにて質問なども募集させていただいておりますので良かったら遊びに来てくださると嬉しいです♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobTs3cZX.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんが乃木坂46を愛してくださる事実が私にとっての何よりの誕生日プレゼントです🎂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "過ごしてきたこの1年は何よりも濃かったですね…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "グループとしてのLIVEや日々の活動に加えて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "秋には個展を開かせていただいたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "CMに個人で出演させていただいたり、その時に堺雅人さんとお話した演技の仕事がしたい！という思いもまだめらめらと持ち続けています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ランウェイを歩く機会をいただき、雑誌や色々な媒体でファッションやモデルについて勉強したり。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "TV、ラジオでのご縁がその先へ繋がっていったり。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41枚目シングル。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いま参加させていただけている全てのお仕事が宝物です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ある意味私にとっての到達点だと思っていた日々も、今のスタートです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分らしく、マイペースという言葉がなによりも大切に思えることもあれば、それが通用しない現実ももちろんあって自分が自分でしかいられないことに悔しく思ったりもしました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそれらの葛藤を総括して言えば、楽しかった！！！です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私を推してくださる皆さん、今の日々を楽しいと思えていますか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうであれば、私は何よりも幸せです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからの1年はもっともっとワクワクさせるからね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブのリハーサルも佳境です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎日起きている間ずっと乃木坂の曲に触れてパフォーマンスについてみんなで考えている時間がとても愛おしいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "宝物が増えました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ファンの皆さんの存在はこのお仕事を出来ているからこそ出会えたものであるし、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この乃木坂46というグループそのものが、自分の気持ちを共有できる何よりも自分の心に近しい存在だなと思います！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "仕事中はその真剣な眼差しに刺激を貰っているけど、プライベートではみんな明るくて楽しくて いっぱい笑顔を貰っています。貰ってばかりじゃダメだね、私も返して行こう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバー全員が個性豊かで、考えていることもその表現の仕方も全然違うけど、それぞれのお仕事への向き合い方の真剣さに触れられる瞬間が凄く...シビれるんだ......！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからこそ私もその気持ちの強さで負けないように全力で今を生きていきたいと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mob9wJ7Xh.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ガンガンさんのグラビアで描かせていただいたあひる🪿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次も一緒に夢をみてくださいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもよろしくお願いします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日の1曲➝最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？/乃木坂46"}], "source": "official"}